          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">XPS Siderails at a glance</span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Our XPS Siderails increase patient surface area while remaining integrated in the cot.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Seven locking positions</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Easily retrofitted to existing compatible cots</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Sturdy aluminum over-mold design</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Mattress design reduces transfer gap</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Compliant with tip stability and dynamic crash certifications*</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Model number: 6506-700-004</b></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-8em\">*Certified to IEC 60601-1 for Power-PRO 2, Power-PRO XT and Power-PRO TL. BS-EN 1789 for Power-PRO 2, Power-PRO XT, Power-PRO TL, and Performance-PRO XT</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jun 02 2025 19:46:58 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
